# Clerk Billing

All subscriptions and payments are handled by Clerk Billing. Never use Stripe directly or any other payment library.

## Plans & Features

**Plans:** `free_user`, `pro`

**Features:** `3_deck_limit`, `unlimited_decks`, `ai_flashcard_generation`

## Gating Access

### Server Components & Actions — use `has()`

```ts
import { auth } from '@clerk/nextjs/server'

const { has } = await auth()

// Check by plan
const isPro = has({ plan: 'pro' })

// Check by feature
const canGenerateAI = has({ feature: 'ai_flashcard_generation' })
const hasUnlimitedDecks = has({ feature: 'unlimited_decks' })
```

### Client / React Components — use `<Protect>`

```tsx
import { Protect } from '@clerk/nextjs'

// By plan
<Protect plan="pro" fallback={<UpgradeCTA />}>
  <ProFeature />
</Protect>

// By feature
<Protect feature="ai_flashcard_generation" fallback={<UpgradeCTA />}>
  <AIGenerator />
</Protect>
```

## Pricing Page

Use Clerk's `<PricingTable />` component on a dedicated `/pricing` page. Do not build a custom pricing table.

```tsx
import { PricingTable } from '@clerk/nextjs'

export default function PricingPage() {
  return (
    <div className="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <PricingTable />
    </div>
  )
}
```
